---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Research · Leonardo Scaramelli">
<a class="back-link" href="/">← Home</a>
  <section id="research" class="section-grid">
    <h2><span class="section-number">02</span> Research</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <article class="research-item">
        <p class="eyebrow">Research project · UCL · 2025–2026</p>
        <h3>Investigating convergence of MALA when the target measure has light tails</h3>
        <p>Step-size randomization through weak Poincaré inequalities, and drift conditions for MALA with lighter-than-Gaussian tails.</p>
        <p class="meta">Supervised by Prof. Samuel Livingstone</p>
      </article>
      <article class="research-item">
        <p class="eyebrow">MSc thesis · Bocconi University · 2025</p>
        <h3>Theoretical Convergence Guarantees of Diffusion Models</h3>
        <p>From Markov processes and functional inequalities to Langevin sampling and convergence guarantees for diffusion models.</p>
        <p class="meta">Advisor: Prof. Giacomo Zanella</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/documents/LS_MScTesi.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the thesis <span>↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="research-item">
        <p class="eyebrow">Visiting student · BIDSA · 2023–2025</p>
        <h3>Bayesian learning & diffusion-based sampling</h3>
        <p>Study of Bayesian nonparametric methods and Schrödinger bridges for accelerating diffusion-based sampling in Bayesian computation, as part of the Bayesian Learning Laboratory.</p>
        <p class="meta">Mentor: Prof. Sonia Petrone</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
